      difficulty: 'Intermediate',
      considerations: [
        'Accumulate the highest total score over multiple hands; win tricks for +1 point each while avoiding Jacks (negative points) and using the Ugly and Charm cards to modify scoring.',
        "Dealer's left picks trump (or no trump). Pass cards (increases each round). Win tricks for +1 pt each. Avoid Jacks (negative). 7â™¦ (Ugly): doubles Jack penalties. 7â™¦ + no Jacks = double trick score. 7â™£ (Charm): cancels Ugly's doubling. Both Ugly+Charm + no Jacks = 4x trick score.",
        '7â™¦ = Ugly Card (doubles Jacks or tricks)',
        '7â™£ = Charm Card (cancels Ugly)',
      ],
    },
